SUMMARY:Autumn panigiri of Agios Dimitrios\, Agios Dimitrios (Raches)
LOCATION:Agios Dimitrios\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The last panigiri of the year on the west side: on 26 October the village of Agios Dimitrios in Raches\, via its cultural association 'I Litani'\, serves roast kid\, mezedes and Ikarian wine with the Stroupa/Zevkalides orchestra. Autumn light\, no tourists\, jackets needed. The village also has summer feasts (a July glendi with the Zevkalides and Agios Fanourios on 27 August).\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#agios-dimitrios-autumn-panigiri-of-agios-dimitrios-agios-dim
